  "body_html": "<h1>Value Of A Zero-Sum Game</h1>\n<p>A zero-sum game has a value if its maxmin and minmax coincide.  In that case\nthe common number is denoted\n$$\n  \\operatorname{val}(G)=\\underline v=\\overline v.\n$$</p>\n<h2>References</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>[MFoGT, Def. 2.2.5] Laraki, Renault, and Sorin, <em>Mathematical Foundations of Game Theory</em>, <code>references/MechDesign.pdf</code>. A zero-sum game has a value when maxmin equals minmax.</li>\n</ul>",
  "proof_html": null,
